["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"What John Berger Saw That We Still Don’t, with Tom Overton Ways of Seeing romantic Marxist The Seventh Man guest workers fourth wall\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-iq2-档案越是庞大-传记越无法中立/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e3caf1589a8bc137-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">42:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Intelligence Squared</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>伯格档案越全越要怀疑：家是两条轴线的交点</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">伯格留下的不是结论，而是一套观看机制：档案越全越要怀疑，家是两条轴线的交点，反殖民立场一生未变。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">文化批评</span><span class=\"tag\">观看之道</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"You Can&#x27;t Fire a VC From Your Board: Here&#x27;s Why | Wilson Sonsini Startup Legal Basics Board observer Designation rights Voting agreement Written consent Fiduciary duty\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-twist-投资人董事请神容易送神难-普通股永远无权罢免/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/aeca85f82817864a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">24:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Startups</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>投资人董事请神容易送神难：普通股永远无权罢免</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">投资人董事席位只由对应类别股选出，创始人持有的普通股没有投票权把它换掉；唯一现实的路径是私下劝退，或等对方自愿降为董事会观察员。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">董事会</span><span class=\"tag\">早期融资</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"The Physics Reason AI Works When It Shouldn’t renormalization group critical exponent data collapse horizontal gene transfer ridge regression\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-intotheimpossi-ai-有效是因为它发生了相变/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7133e1b0fe88d6bc-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:17:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Into the Impossible With Brian Keating</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>AI 没塌缩是因为发生了相变，不是参数更多</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">物理学家 Nigel Goldenfeld 用重正化群和相变解释 AI 在万亿参数下仍没塌缩的机制，并把同一套框架用于回答遗传密码为何唯一。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">相变</span><span class=\"tag\">重正化群</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"First Benchmark Results on an OpenAI GPU speculative decoding multi-token prediction (MTP) time to last token (TTLT) MXFP4 scale-up / scale-out domain Tomahawk 6\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-techtechpotato-自研芯片百倍领先-基准选择与商业筹码才是关键/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fba1bec187512ffb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">31:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">TechTechPotato</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>OpenAI 自研芯片领先百倍？那是自选基准加专用栈</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI 首颗自研芯片 Jalapeno 在自选基准上把 GB200 甩开 100 倍，但那是专用芯片、专用模型、专用软件栈的结果；真正的护城河是系统集成和定价权。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">芯片设计</span><span class=\"tag\">OpenAI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"具身智能的“山寨机时代”：亲历2026世界机器人大会，我们的48个观察-Vol 104 VLA ODM UWB Zero-shot\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-cn768a8a-具身智能的山寨机时代-没人赚钱但18家互投/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ac5fc3c22c8141af-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"脑\"><span class=\"dur\">51:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">脑放电波</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>机器人大会48个观察：没人赚钱，18家却互投36笔</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2026世界机器人大会的48个观察：机器人拼装化、真demo出现、定语通胀；行业没人赚钱，却有18家企业投资36笔，本体成本三年降十倍。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">人形机器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Dylan Patel – Anthropic &amp; OpenAI will have most of the world’s compute by 2028 FLOP RSI hyperscaler crowding-out effect continual learning\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-dwarkesh-2028-年前两家实验室将控制全球大部分算力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/59e51ac2f0c2b285-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>算力正以每年数倍速度向两家实验室集中，2028 年它们将控制全球大部分算力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">算力正以每年数倍速度向 Anthropic 和 OpenAI 集中，到 2028 年它们将控制全球大部分有效算力，并可能把算力价格推到每兆瓦 5000 万美元，进而引发主权债务危机。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">实验室经济学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"The Return to the Chamber of Mysteries EMC Slot antenna Grounded coplanar waveguide QSFP cage Line (EMC chamber)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-oxide-emc-合规是玄学吗-一次机架级辐射超标排障记/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6b5eb6a03ee5e8af-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Oxide and Friends</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>机架辐射超标两轮无解，解法藏在一场无关会议里</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">机架后侧 26.565GHz 辐射超标，排查两轮无果，最终靠一场无关会议上的论文找到解法：在连接器上加吸波材料。这不是玄学，是高频物理。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">EMC</span><span class=\"tag\">硬件工程</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"The New Economics of AI | Martin Casado &amp; Steven Sinofsky Foom TAM in-distribution Mythical man-month expert systems\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-a16z-ai-正在把工程问题变成资本问题/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>AI 把软件业从工程约束变成资本约束</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Martin Casado 与 Steven Sinofsky 的核心判断：AI 把软件业从工程约束变成资本约束——20 人的团队也能有效花掉 10 亿美元，创业公司因此能和巨头同场竞争。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">资本</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Future of AI in the Workplace | Special Episode (Mike Sullivan and Vinay Gidwaney) work genome reducible / irreducible workforce intelligence score amplification score intelligence lock-in PIP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-rationalreminder-ai-时代该由-hr-主导-不是-it-把-ai-当员工雇进来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0b9befd958d3d16f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:30:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>AI 时代该由 HR 主导，不是 IT：把 AI 当员工雇进来</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把 AI 当技术采购交给 IT，是把主菜当配菜；真正要拆的是任务而不是岗位，该主导这件事的是 HR，因为 AI 没有感受，而人需要。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 落地</span><span class=\"tag\">组织变革</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"495 陆大鹏谈莎士比亚戏剧与英国历史的互相影响 intertextuality\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-cn2aa250-莎士比亚历史剧是都铎王朝的宣传工具/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cb6acd126210dffb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"忽\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">忽左忽右</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>莎士比亚历史剧是都铎王朝的宣传工具</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">莎翁历史剧歪曲史实极多，本质是都铎王朝的政治宣传：丑化理查三世、回避亨利八世敏感话题，从而巩固本朝合法性。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">莎士比亚</span><span class=\"tag\">英国历史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"This Is Why People Hate the Government time tax ordeal mechanism improper payment only-once policy\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-ezra-时间税-行政羞辱是穷人恨政府的原因/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a8482192037a6711-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:17:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Ezra Klein Show</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>行政羞辱是穷人恨政府的原因：福利申请像一场时间税</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">政府福利项目中的行政负担不是效率问题，而是社会控制工具：它用羞辱和文书惩罚穷人，把进步政策变成筛选少数人的漏斗，最终让受益者恨上政府。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">福利制度</span><span class=\"tag\">行政负担</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Back by Popular Demand: How to support your child&#x27;s secure attachment even if you didn&#x27;t grow up with it with Dr. Miriam Steele Strange Situation Adult Attachment Interview reflective functioning good enough mother still face\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-secureattach-童年逆境不必传给孩子-会讲自己的故事就能打断代际循环/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ddcbe6658f0e30d7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">50:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Securely Attached</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>童年逆境不必传给孩子：会讲自己的故事就能打断代际循环</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">伦敦亲子项目发现，父母能否用连贯、灵活的方式讲述自己的童年，比童年本身好坏更能预测孩子是否安全依恋——反思功能是可训练的技能。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">依恋理论</span><span class=\"tag\">养育</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Parallel’s Parag Agrawal: Building a New Web for AI Agents Shapley value grounding fresh index memory hierarchy\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-trainingdata-人类点击数据是-bug-agent-搜索重建网络经济/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bca134f7cdc5e5aa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">55:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Training Data</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>人类点击数据是 Bug：Agent 搜索要重做索引与定价</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">当搜索的客户从人变成 Agent，点击数据失效，索引、定价与商业模式都要重来；Parag 用质量/成本/延迟三角和 Shapley 给出新框架。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Agent 搜索</span><span class=\"tag\">网络经济</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Neil Movva - Making AI 10x Cheaper - [Invest Like the Best, EP.488] KV cache HBM SRAM Tensor Core Harness\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-ilt-推理成本需降3-6个数量级-后台任务才是主战场/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/32e8a839c878b0c2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:18:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>后台Agent将吃掉90%算力，推理优化该为吞吐牺牲延迟</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI推理的下一波不在聊天而在后台Agent，后者将吃掉90%算力。Sale Research为此优化吞吐而非延迟，甚至接受80%可用性，以换取价格降几个数量级，并认为Nvidia每瓦优势被高估。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI推理</span><span class=\"tag\">GPU</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"286: ENCORE: Getting into College with Rick Clark holistic review test-optional Common App FAFSA net price calculator\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-asklisa-申请没有万能配方-美国大学录取的反焦虑真相/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ace27132dfc1e3aa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">48:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>录取没有万能配方：美国大学申请的反焦虑真相</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">低录取率只是全国约 80 所名校的叙事；对多数家庭，录取没有公式，家长最有用的是固定会议和「控制可控项」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美本申请</span><span class=\"tag\">录取率</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Auschwitz: An SS officer’s photo album Solahütte Counterintelligence Corps Frankfurt Auschwitz Trials\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-witness-纳粹屠夫的私人相册-没有惨状只有蓝莓和假期/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4ad7b76f4c635f2c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"W\"><span class=\"dur\">10:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Witness History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>纳粹军官相册里没有暴行，只有蓝莓和假期</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一本 SS 军官私人相册记录的并非暴行，而是度假、聚餐和摘蓝莓；它证明屠杀者清楚自己在做什么，也提醒我们理解大屠杀必须看向施害者。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大屠杀</span><span class=\"tag\">纳粹</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"84.49 家央企采买进场，史上最热WRC：泡沫被挤压，具身行业进入实战阶段｜14 年从业者的行家鉴别指南 VLA World Model Teleoperation EMG Data Pipeline Post-training\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-lightstar-两万台出货九成吃灰-具身行业进入算roi的实战期/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/adbddf5c93cfc63c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"卫\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">漫谈Light the Star</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>两万台出货九成吃灰：具身行业进入算ROI的实战期</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">WRC的热浪之下，真正做预训练的创业公司可能只有一两家，真实落地需求可能只有出货量的10%，行业已从秀demo进入算ROI的实战阶段。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">人形机器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"How Intel&#x27;s New CPU Finally Makes Sense Fan-out fabric architecture Compute building block Fabric hub UCIe Foveros 3D Direct\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-techtechpotato-下一代-xeon-把宝押在-1-2gb-末级缓存上/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fc7c90dc34e0b3f0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">21:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">TechTechPotato</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>Intel 弃用 EMIB 改 UCIe：1.2GB 缓存堆出 256 核</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Diamond Rapids 预计 2027 年发布，最高 256 个 P-core、1.2GB 末级缓存、16 通道 DDR5；用可裁剪的 compute building block 和 UCIe 互连取代 EMIB，大缓存是它对抗 AI 时代的关键。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">CPU 架构</span><span class=\"tag\">数据中心</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Michael Kratsios: Trump&#x27;s Science Agenda, Anti-Science Claims, Fauci&#x27;s Damage, DEI &amp; China Eroom&#x27;s Law golden tickets RCP 8.5 GRFP Genesis Mission OSTP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-24-allin-美国科学不是缺钱-是花钱方式错了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/527571f45bcd0e49-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">55:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0824</span></div>\n<h2>美国科学不是缺钱，是花钱方式错了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">NIH 预算从 1998 年 140 亿涨到 2024 年 470 亿，产出效率却每 9 年腰斩一次。Kratsios 的答案是：问题不在预算数字，在拨款机制本身。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">科技政策</span><span class=\"tag\">科研拨款</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"95% of AI Agent Projects Fail to Reach Production. Here&#x27;s Why | Manoj Saxena, TrustWise runtime governance AI control tower guardian agents semantic action layer trust posture management\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-24-eyeonai-智能体流量首超人类-ai-失控才是落地最大瓶颈/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b277eb062496b5a5-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Eye On A.I.</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0824</span></div>\n<h2>95% 的 AI 智能体项目死在试点：缺的不是智能，是控制层</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 已从内容生成走向自主行动：95% 的 agent 项目困在 pilot，进不了生产，因为缺的不是智能，而是运行时控制层。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">智能体</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 治理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Will Photonics Loosen the Bottlenecks in Neural Systems? WDM (Wavelength Division Multiplexing) Semiconductor Optical Amplifier (SOA) McCulloch-Pitts neuron model Indium Phosphide (InP) Femtojoule per operation TDM (Time Division Multiplexing)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-24-brainsandmachi-光子计算第三次浪潮-五年内走出实验室-先征服无人机/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9151fd6dae1293cb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"B\"><span class=\"dur\">45:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Brains and Machines</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0824</span></div>\n<h2>光子计算第三次浪潮：五年内走出实验室，先征服无人机</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">光子不能像电子那样相互作用，却能用波长复用实现超大并行和超低延迟。全光学神经网络五年内有望落地，第一站不是服务器，而是无人机和实时控制。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">光子计算</span><span class=\"tag\">神经形态</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Has the Solid State Transformer’s Time Finally Come? Solid State Transformer (SST) IGBT Silicon Carbide (SiC) Galvanic isolation 800VDC architecture PETT\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-24-asianometry-固态变压器吹了五十年-ai数据中心是第一个真买家/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a4d5049243d5f237-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0824</span></div>\n<h2>固态变压器吹了五十年，AI数据中心是第一个真买家</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">固态变压器在海军、高铁、智能电网里试了三次都没成，因为它只是「更小」,而AI数据中心的铜线和800伏直流问题第一次给了它必须存在的理由。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">电力电子</span><span class=\"tag\">数据中心供电</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"317. Plot Twist: The Second Story Hiding Inside Every Great Pitch pitch gatekeeper auteur\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-24-thinkfast-好提案藏着两个故事-你的故事和对方升职的故事/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7fd7a03d438b4365-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">24:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Think Fast Talk Smart</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0824</span></div>\n<h2>提案要讲两个故事：一个是项目，一个是对方升职</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">好莱坞编剧 Rhett Reese 揭示提案的本质：表面讲项目故事，暗线讲对方成功的故事。把对方当主角，降低风险、放大回报，提案成功率大增。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">提案技巧</span><span class=\"tag\">沟通</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"365 | Vitor Cardoso on Why Black Holes Are Special no-hair theorem Kerr metric light ring cosmic censorship matched filtering last parsec problem\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-24-mindscape-黑洞只有两个参数-形成机制却仍是谜/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d69097efcbd03611-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Mindscape</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0824</span></div>\n<h2>黑洞只有两个参数，形成机制却仍是谜</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">引力波与 EHT 确认黑洞确实只有两个参数，但 120 倍太阳质量的黑洞如何形成、暗物质是否由微型黑洞构成、最后 1 秒差距如何跨越，都是未解之谜。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">黑洞</span><span class=\"tag\">引力波</span>\n</div></div></a>"]